  "details": "As Rec Room and Horizon World sunsets, one of their strongest points towards user-generated content creation were the abilities to build content natively within the app.\n\nVRChat should create a free toolbox for users to summon in their worlds, with the goal of allowing creators to make and publish persistent content on-the-fly.\n\nUdon Node Graph GUI and debugging: VRChat's SDK should expand to this toolbox system within the client, and allow people to script Udon and Creator Economy \"gizmos\".\n\nSimilar posts: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/in-world-avatar-and-world-creation",
